# Backend base URL.
# - Leave EMPTY for local development: Vite proxies /api/* to the server in vite.config.js.
# - In production set it to the API origin (no trailing slash), e.g.
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://server-rajdhaniserver-dbitqs-9932f2-62-84-177-235.sslip.io
#   OR leave empty and serve the app behind a reverse proxy that forwards /api to the backend.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
